bounded_repairs_implemented.summary:
Framed preimage with header 'uos.telegram-store.apply.v2
', length-prefixed strings (<len>:<str>
), counts (<N>
), canonical decimal integers, and deterministic key sorting. Prevents delimiter injection attacks. Upgraded schema_version to 'uos.telegram-store.v2' and strictly refuses old v1 DBs. Replay lookup verifies digest equality; mismatch returns operation_collision_digest_mismatch.
